# steps/free-names.md (class B): k is -1 in the caller and nothing catches -- big's implicit throw `convert` passes
# through go to the root, which receives status 3 (unit_b3_init_conv_range).
fn: big () size_t
    return: k
fn: go () int
    int: k -1
    size_t: got 0U
    got: big()
    return: 7

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: go(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
